# Observability

## Purpose

Establish observability standards so the SelOps platform is understandable in production.

## Guidelines

- Every service exposes a /health and /metrics endpoint.
- Distributed traces span module boundaries using standard context propagation.
- Log levels: ERROR for actionable failures, WARN for degraded-but-recoverable, INFO for lifecycle events.

